# Ray & CDSW networking — frozen

The Cloudera AI Ray stack is wired per **`docs/CAI_RAY_NETWORKING.md`** (master `CDSW_IP_ADDRESS:6379`, workers `CDSW_MASTER_IP:6379`, verified GCS auth). The user treats this as **production-stable** after manual validation.

## Do not change (unless the user **explicitly** requests networking / Ray / worker / GCS work)

- `docs/CAI_RAY_NETWORKING.md`
- `backend/app/services/cai_networking.py`
- `backend/app/services/ray_cai_networking.py`
- `backend/app/services/ray_driver_connect.py`
- `backend/app/services/ray_gcs_auth.py`
- `backend/app/services/cdsw_workers.py`
- `backend/app/services/cdsw_worker_codegen.py` (embedded worker head resolution)
- `backend/app/services/ray_cluster_watch.py` (GCS subprocess probes used by jobs)
- `backend/app/services/job_parallel_startup.py` (worker probe / GCS wait paths)
- `backend/app/services/nccl_env.py` (GPU Train NCCL defaults on workers)
- `scripts/common.py` — only **`bootstrap_cai_ray_env`**, **`start_ray_head`**, **`_sync_ray_auth_env`**
- `scripts/start.py` — only **CAI Ray bootstrap / `PLATFORM_RAY_START_AT_BOOT` / head-deferred messaging**
- Tests: `backend/test_ray_cai_networking.py`, `backend/test_ray_gcs_auth.py`, `backend/test_verified_gcs_auth.py`, `backend/test_platform_ray_health.py`, and other tests whose **primary purpose** is Ray GCS/worker networking

## Allowed without an explicit networking request

- Unrelated features (UI, datasets, SQLite, jobs API) even if they **import** networking helpers — do not refactor networking while doing so.
- **Docs/README** outside `CAI_RAY_NETWORKING.md` unless they change networking behavior claims.

## When the user explicitly asks

They must clearly request changes to Ray networking, GCS auth, CDSW workers, worker probe, or CAI head startup. Then you may edit the paths above and **must** extend or run the networking tests listed in `CAI_RAY_NETWORKING.md`.

## If a bug seems networking-related but the user did not ask

Describe the likely ops fix (`ray stop --force`, remove `data/.ray_gcs_auth_token`, `git pull`, restart `start.py`) and ask whether to change networking code — **do not patch by default**.
